Given smarty (chained modifiers):
  {$articleTitle|lower|spacify|truncate:30:"foo"}

Execute (chained modifiers):
  AssertEqual 'smartyModifier', SyntaxOf('lower')
  AssertEqual 'smartyModifier', SyntaxOf('spacify')
  AssertEqual 'smartyModifier', SyntaxOf('truncate')
  AssertEqual 'smartyParameter', SyntaxOf('30')
  AssertEqual 'smartyStringDouble', SyntaxOf('foo')

############################################

Given smarty (modifier with variable parameters):
  {$text|replace:$search:$replace}

Execute (modifier with variable parameters):
  AssertEqual 'smartyModifier', SyntaxOf('replace')
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf('search')
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf('replace', 2)
